<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/34/msa@/~part_I__cl_3__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "banduan yang dilepaskan dengan parol; dan"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/34/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/34/msa@/~part_I__cl_3__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/34/msa@/~part_I__cl_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/34/msa@> .
